WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,070 --> 00:00:08,870
Page 52 Project 2 Judy the Rabbit

2
00:00:08,870 --> 00:00:22,400
Hi, I'm Judy. I'm a rabbit. In spring it's warm. I can see beautiful flowers.

3
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:35,130
I like to chase the butterflies. In summer it's hot. I like to look at the frogs.

4
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:47,640
And I like to listen to the rain. In autumn it's cool. I like to look at the leaves.

5
00:00:47,640 --> 00:01:00,870
I like to pick sweet fruit. In winter it's cold. I like to look at the white snow.

6
00:01:00,870 --> 00:01:06,840
Then I can have a nice dream in my home.
